{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - User - MFA - Okta MFA Factors Reset for a User",
	"Description": "Every MFA factor on an account was reset. After a reset the account can enrol a new factor on the next sign-in, so an adversary with a stolen password resets the factors and then enrols their own device.\n\nEvent type: user.mfa.factor.reset_all\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/elastic/detection-rules/integrations/okta/credential_access_attempt_to_reset_mfa_factors_for_okta_user_account/\n- https://github.com/elastic/detection-rules/tree/main/rules/integrations/okta/credential_access_attempt_to_reset_mfa_factors_for_okta_user_account.toml",
